From: Y2Linux maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Report music formats and Reborn library tags

libmtp track clients (Strawberry, mtp-tracks) skip objects of format
Undefined and take the title from the Name property. Report music files
by extension (MP3, WAV, WMA, OGG, AAC, M4A, FLAC) and serve Name, Artist,
Album, AlbumArtist, Track, Duration, Genre, SampleRate, NumberOfChannels
and AudioBitRate from Reborn's library, opened read-only. Without a
usable library the Name of a music file is its file name without
extension. ObjectFileName stays the real file name.

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index 32de1d5..57ea40f 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 CFLAGS += -I./inc -Wall
-LDFLAGS += -lpthread -lrt
+LDFLAGS += -lpthread -lrt -lsqlite3
 
 sources := $(wildcard src/*.c)
 objects := $(sources:src/%.c=obj/%.o)
